{:edb/db-before-t 2434 :edb/db-after-t 2435 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535747 50 #inst "2026-10-09T06:28:49.280Z" 13194139535747 true] [17592186129131 1020 #edb/ref 17592186364599 13194139535747 true] [17592186129131 1020 #edb/ref 17592186364606 13194139535747 true] [17592186129211 1020 #edb/ref 17592186364613 13194139535747 true] [17592186129211 1020 #edb/ref 17592186364620 13194139535747 true] [17592186129211 1020 #edb/ref 17592186364627 13194139535747 true] [17592186364599 1017 #edb/ref 17592186364600 13194139535747 true] [17592186364599 1089 "q-161276" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364599 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535747 true] [17592186364599 1100 "Evaluate the triple integral \n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}\\frac{z{sec}^{2}⁡x}{y}\\,\\text{d}V\n$$\n\nover the box $R={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,-\\frac{\\pi }{4}\\le x\\le \\frac{\\pi }{3},\\,{e}^{2}\\le y\\le {e}^{5},\\,0\\le z\\le 4}.$" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364599 1113 #uuid "d3e328fe-736e-5356-b9c9-6e5d01ab2fb3" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364599 1145 "First, we express our triple integral as a repeated integral:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∭}_{R}\\frac{z{sec}^{2}⁡x}{y}\\,\\text{d}V & ={\\int }_{0}^{4}{\\int }_{{e}^{2}}^{{e}^{5}}{\\int }_{-\\pi /4}^{\\pi /3}\\frac{z{sec}^{2}⁡x}{y}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}z\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the domain of integration $R=[-\\frac{\\pi }{4},\\frac{\\pi }{3}]\\times [{e}^{2},{e}^{5}]\\times [0,4]$ is a rectangular box, and the integrand can be expressed as $f(x)\\cdot g(y)\\cdot h(z),$ we can rewrite our repeated integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{4}{\\int }_{{e}^{2}}^{{e}^{5}}{\\int }_{-\\pi /4}^{\\pi /3}\\frac{z{sec}^{2}⁡x}{y}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}z & ={\\int }_{0}^{4}{\\int }_{{e}^{2}}^{{e}^{5}}{\\int }_{-\\pi /4}^{\\pi /3}{sec}^{2}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot z\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}z \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-\\pi /4}^{\\pi /3}{sec}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x{\\int }_{{e}^{2}}^{{e}^{5}}\\frac{1}{y}\\,\\text{d}y{\\int }_{0}^{4}z\\,\\text{d}z\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating each integral separately, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\pi /4}^{\\pi /3}{sec}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x{\\int }_{{e}^{2}}^{{e}^{5}}\\frac{1}{y}\\,\\text{d}y{\\int }_{0}^{4}z\\,\\text{d}z & =[\\operatorname{tan}⁡x]_{-\\pi /4}^{\\pi /3}\\cdot [\\operatorname{ln}⁡y]_{{e}^{2}}^{{e}^{5}}\\cdot {[\\frac{{z}^{2}}{2}]}_{0}^{4} \\\\  & =(\\sqrt{3}+1)\\cdot (5-2)\\cdot (8-0) \\\\  & =(\\sqrt{3}+1)\\cdot 3\\cdot 8 \\\\  & =24(\\sqrt{3}+1).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364600 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364601 13194139535747 true] [17592186364600 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364602 13194139535747 true] [17592186364600 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364603 13194139535747 true] [17592186364600 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364604 13194139535747 true] [17592186364600 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364605 13194139535747 true] [17592186364600 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535747 true] [17592186364600 1041 "selection" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364600 1104 #edb/ref 17592186364603 13194139535747 true] [17592186364600 1110 #uuid "7490fd5c-74ef-59af-945c-78603596dcf2" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364601 1034 "12\\sqrt{3}" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364601 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535747 true] [17592186364601 1111 #uuid "f8d25cc6-d64f-55e9-8ca4-c04105e01075" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364602 1034 "2\\sqrt{3}-1" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364602 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535747 true] [17592186364602 1111 #uuid "90453a3a-fc31-5a46-a016-ea3269196bca" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364603 1034 "24(\\sqrt{3}+1)" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364603 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535747 true] [17592186364603 1111 #uuid "dc710635-5cf0-58be-a70a-d93edbd652dc" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364604 1034 "12(\\sqrt{3}-1)" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364604 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535747 true] [17592186364604 1111 #uuid "7a622241-5df4-50d5-9447-5cb7979bf5c2" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364605 1034 "4(\\sqrt{3}-1)" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364605 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535747 true] [17592186364605 1111 #uuid "a157230c-ea16-5ad9-9950-c74921a7dd88" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364606 1017 #edb/ref 17592186364607 13194139535747 true] [17592186364606 1089 "q-161279" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364606 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535747 true] [17592186364606 1100 "Evaluate the triple integral \n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}\\frac{{3}^{y-1}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{z-4}\\,\\text{d}V\n$$\n\nover the box $R={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,\\frac{\\pi }{3}\\le x\\le \\frac{\\pi }{2},\\,0\\le y\\le 1,\\,5\\le z\\le 7}.$" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364606 1113 #uuid "73d193b7-b76c-51ef-bc22-10cbc20da8cc" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364606 1145 "First, we express our triple integral as a repeated integral:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∭}_{R}\\frac{{3}^{y-1}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{z-4}\\,\\text{d}V & ={\\int }_{5}^{7}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{\\pi /3}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{{3}^{y-1}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{z-4}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}z\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the domain of integration $R=[\\frac{\\pi }{3},\\frac{\\pi }{2}]\\times [0,1]\\times [5,7]$ is a rectangular box and the integrand can be expressed as $f(x)\\cdot g(y)\\cdot h(z),$ we can rewrite our repeated integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{5}^{7}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{\\pi /3}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{{3}^{y-1}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{z-4}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}z & ={\\int }_{5}^{7}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{\\pi /3}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{{3}^{y-1}\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{z-4}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}z \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\pi /3}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x{\\int }_{0}^{1}{3}^{y-1}\\,\\text{d}y{\\int }_{5}^{7}\\frac{1}{z-4}\\,\\text{d}z\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating each integral separately, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /3}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x{\\int }_{0}^{1}{3}^{y-1}\\,\\text{d}y{\\int }_{5}^{7}\\frac{1}{z-4}\\,\\text{d}z & =[-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x]_{\\pi /3}^{\\pi /2}\\cdot {[\\frac{{3}^{y-1}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}]}_{0}^{1}\\cdot [\\operatorname{ln}⁡(z-4)]_{5}^{7} \\\\  & =(-0+\\frac{1}{2})\\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}-\\frac{1}{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡3})\\cdot (\\operatorname{ln}⁡3-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{2}{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡3 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364607 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364608 13194139535747 true] [17592186364607 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364609 13194139535747 true] [17592186364607 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364610 13194139535747 true] [17592186364607 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364611 13194139535747 true] [17592186364607 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364612 13194139535747 true] [17592186364607 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535747 true] [17592186364607 1041 "selection" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364607 1104 #edb/ref 17592186364611 13194139535747 true] [17592186364607 1110 #uuid "5675ef25-4591-5230-bcc4-94fe0e3407cb" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364608 1034 "\\frac{2}{3\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364608 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535747 true] [17592186364608 1111 #uuid "d428cf90-7455-53cd-a734-12adbacf3f76" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364609 1034 "3" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364609 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535747 true] [17592186364609 1111 #uuid "7b9a2965-8003-5843-8446-81ce630055cb" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364610 1034 "3\\operatorname{ln}⁡3" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364610 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535747 true] [17592186364610 1111 #uuid "332deba6-4911-5fb2-a185-a5b27ed79770" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364611 1034 "\\frac{1}{3}" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364611 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535747 true] [17592186364611 1111 #uuid "5f0dda4b-ca24-55d6-931d-b79b44779a2a" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364612 1034 "\\frac{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3-3}" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364612 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535747 true] [17592186364612 1111 #uuid "33464de5-eeaf-5f1b-a561-39b377c89dc8" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364613 1017 #edb/ref 17592186364614 13194139535747 true] [17592186364613 1089 "q-161369" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364613 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535747 true] [17592186364613 1100 "By integrating first with respect to $y,$ then $x,$ and then $z,$ evaluate the triple integral \n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}{x}^{2}z+\\frac{1}{y}\\,dV\n$$\n\nover the rectangular box $R={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 2,\\,1\\le y\\le 3,\\,-1\\le z\\le 1}.$" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364613 1113 #uuid "2f2caf16-d1bb-5667-87e0-25c7b5604d46" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364613 1145 "First, we express our triple integral as a repeated integral:\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}{x}^{2}z+\\frac{1}{y}\\,\\text{d}V={\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{1}^{3}{x}^{2}z+\\frac{1}{y}\\,dy\\,dx\\,dz\n$$\n\nSince we're integrating first with respect to $y,$ then $x,$ and then $z,$ we write $\\text{d}V=\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}z.$\n\nFirst, we evaluate the inner integral with respect to $y,$ treating $x$ and $z$ as constants: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{1}^{3}{x}^{2}z+\\frac{1}{y}\\,dy\\,dx\\,dz & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}[{\\int }_{1}^{3}{x}^{2}z+\\frac{1}{y}\\,dy]dx\\,dz \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}[{x}^{2}zy+\\operatorname{ln}⁡|y|]_{y=1}^{y=3}\\,dx\\,dz \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{x}^{2}z(3-1)+(\\operatorname{ln}⁡3-0)\\,dx\\,dz \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}2{x}^{2}z+\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\,dx\\,dz\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the inner integral with respect to $x,$ treating $z$ as a constant: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}2{x}^{2}z+\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\,dx\\,dz & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}[{\\int }_{0}^{2}2z{x}^{2}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\,dx]dz \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}{[\\frac{2}{3}\\,z{x}^{3}+x\\operatorname{ln}⁡3]}_{x=0}^{x=2}\\,dz \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}\\frac{2}{3}\\,z(8-0)+(2-0)\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\,dz \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}\\frac{16}{3}\\,z+2\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\,dz\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $z:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1}^{1}\\frac{16}{3}z+2\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\,dz & ={[\\frac{8}{3}{z}^{2}+2z\\operatorname{ln}⁡3]}_{z=-1}^{z=1} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}(1-1)+2(1-(-1))\\operatorname{ln}⁡3 \\\\  & =4\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364614 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364615 13194139535747 true] [17592186364614 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364616 13194139535747 true] [17592186364614 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364617 13194139535747 true] [17592186364614 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364618 13194139535747 true] [17592186364614 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364619 13194139535747 true] [17592186364614 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535747 true] [17592186364614 1041 "selection" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364614 1104 #edb/ref 17592186364619 13194139535747 true] [17592186364614 1110 #uuid "eaff2740-5411-5502-9b3a-1d86c5d6869d" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364615 1034 "2\\operatorname{ln}⁡3" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364615 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535747 true] [17592186364615 1111 #uuid "0b2ef00c-10eb-5571-baea-a9225476dc70" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364616 1034 "3-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364616 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535747 true] [17592186364616 1111 #uuid "a00ba570-675c-55f3-bd57-552bbecc21c3" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364617 1034 "3\\operatorname{ln}⁡2" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364617 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535747 true] [17592186364617 1111 #uuid "e99b9aa6-42c5-51f0-ab37-281781c669d8" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364618 1034 "2-\\operatorname{ln}⁡3" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364618 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535747 true] [17592186364618 1111 #uuid "03ed23cc-46a4-5b01-ad52-94e9e238e490" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364619 1034 "4\\operatorname{ln}⁡3" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364619 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535747 true] [17592186364619 1111 #uuid "1bebea91-bc29-559f-b331-5a9e6d54aa3c" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364620 1017 #edb/ref 17592186364621 13194139535747 true] [17592186364620 1089 "q-161371" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364620 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535747 true] [17592186364620 1100 "By integrating first with respect to $y,$ then $z,$ and then $x,$ evaluate the triple integral \n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+y+z)\\,dV\n$$\n\nover the rectangular box $R={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le \\frac{\\pi }{2},\\,0\\le y\\le \\pi ,\\,0\\le z\\le \\pi }.$" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364620 1113 #uuid "fa9615c9-2f4c-558d-98ca-9888f1aa6991" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364620 1145 "First, we express our triple integral as a repeated integral:\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+y+z)\\,\\text{d}V={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+y+z)\\,dy\\,dz\\,dx\n$$\n\nSince we're integrating first with respect to $y,$ then $z,$ and then $x,$ we write $\\text{d}V=\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}x.$\n\nFirst, we evaluate the inner integral with respect to $y,$ treating $x$ and $z$ as constants: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+y+z)\\,dy\\,dz\\,dx & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }[{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+y+z)\\,dy]dz\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }[-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+y+z)]_{0}^{\\pi }\\,dz\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+z+\\pi )+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+z+0)\\,dz\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+z)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+z)\\,dz\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+z)\\,dz\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the inner integral with respect to $z,$ treating $x$ as a constant: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+z)\\,dz\\,dx & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}[{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+z)\\,dz]dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}2[\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+z)]_{z=0}^{z=\\pi }\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}2(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+\\pi )-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+0))\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}2(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)\\,dx \\\\  & =-4{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-4{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,dx & =4[\\operatorname{cos}⁡x]_{x=0}^{x=\\pi /2} \\\\  & =4(0-1) \\\\  & =-4\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364621 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364622 13194139535747 true] [17592186364621 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364623 13194139535747 true] [17592186364621 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364624 13194139535747 true] [17592186364621 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364625 13194139535747 true] [17592186364621 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364626 13194139535747 true] [17592186364621 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535747 true] [17592186364621 1041 "selection" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364621 1104 #edb/ref 17592186364626 13194139535747 true] [17592186364621 1110 #uuid "c879a12b-271a-5d66-9053-8a5ffa9758d2" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364622 1034 "-8" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364622 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535747 true] [17592186364622 1111 #uuid "7ffe1951-4f77-5409-bcc7-f42b39234d12" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364623 1034 "2" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364623 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535747 true] [17592186364623 1111 #uuid "e6c84677-09fd-5b94-9ce1-2c957c13f7df" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364624 1034 "6" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364624 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535747 true] [17592186364624 1111 #uuid "d8426022-84f7-5f1e-a0e8-bd77259efabd" 13194139535747 true] [17592186364625 1034 "1" 